@coalition

Governing Arrangement:

Current Caversket Support: [+ custom_coalition_merf +]%

**Coalition:** [? if sapd_merf_coa = 1: <span style="color: #940000;">KPM</span> ?][? if asum_merf_coa = 1: <span style="color: #dd5b00;">ASUM</span> ?] <span style="color: #dc0200;">**[+ spd_name +]**</span> [? if spm_merf_coa = 1: <span style="color: #ff1919;">SPM</span> ?][? if vsp_merf_coa = 1: <span style="color: #ff7b00;">VSP</span> ?][? if fvp_merf_coa = 1: <span style="color: #ddd500;">FVP</span> ?][? if gdsu_merf_coa = 1: <span style="color: #48ba48;">GDSU</span> ?][? if blpm_merf_coa = 1: <span style="color: #00e8ff;">BLPM</span> ?][? if ppu_merf_coa = 1: <span style="color: #4b9fde;">PPU</span> ?][? if ldp_merf_coa = 1: <span style="color: #caa58b;">[+ dvp_name +]</span> ?]

Opposition: [? if sapd_merf_coa = 0 and sapd_formed = 1: <span style="color: #940000;">KPM</span> ?][? if asum_merf_coa = 0 and asum_formed = 1: <span style="color: #dd5b00;">ASUM</span> ?][? if spm_merf_coa = 0 and spm_formed = 1: <span style="color: #ff1919;">SPM</span> ?][? if vsp_merf_coa = 0: <span style="color: #ff7b00;">VSP</span> ?][? if fvp_merf_coa = 0: <span style="color: #ddd500;">FVP</span> ?][? if gdsu_merf_coa = 0: <span style="color: #48ba48;">GDSU</span> ?][? if blpm_merf_coa = 0 and blpm_formed = 1: <span style="color: #00e8ff;">BLPM</span> ?][? if ppu_merf_coa = 0: <span style="color: #4b9fde;">PPU</span> ?][? if ldp_merf_coa = 0: <span style="color: #caa58b;">[+ dvp_name +]</span> ?]

-@kpm_gov: We should try a colaition with the <span style="color: #940000;">KPM</span>.
-@kpm_gov_drop: Leave the <span style="color: #940000;">KPM</span> out of the coalition.
-@asum_gov: We should try a colaition with the <span style="color: #dd5b00;">ASUM</span>.
-@asum_gov_drop: Leave the <span style="color: #dd5b00;">ASUM</span> out of the coalition.
-@spm_gov: We should try a colaition with the <span style="color: #ff1919;">SPM</span>.
-@spm_gov_drop: Leave the <span style="color: #ff1919;">SPM</span> out of the coalition.
-@vsp_gov: We should try a colaition with the <span style="color: #ff7b00;">VSP</span>.
-@vsp_gov_drop: Leave the <span style="color: #ff7b00;">VSP</span> out of the coalition.
-@fvp_gov: We should try a colaition with the <span style="color: #ddd500;">FVP</span>.
-@fvp_gov_drop: Leave the <span style="color: #ddd500;">FVP</span> out of the coalition.
-@gdsu_gov: We should try a colaition with the <span style="color: #48ba48;">GDSU</span>.
-@gdsu_gov_drop: Leave the <span style="color: #48ba48;">GDSU</span> out of the coalition.
-@ppu_gov: We should try a colaition with the <span style="color: #4b9fde;">PPU</span>.
-@ppu_gov_drop: Leave the <span style="color: #4b9fde;">PPU</span> out of the coalition.
-@ldp_gov: We should try a colaition with the <span style="color: #caa58b;">[+ dvp_name +]</span>.
-@ldp_gov_drop: Leave the <span style="color: #caa58b;">[+ dvp_name +]</span> out of the coalition.
-@custom: We can try this arrnagment to work.
-@return: Return to the "normal" coalitions.

@return
go-to: coalition_menu

@kpm_gov
view-if: sapd_formed > 0 and sapd_merf_coa = 0
choose-if: kpm_coa >= 50
on-arrival: sapd_merf_coa = 1; custom_coalition_merf += sapd_merf; ldp_coa -= 20; blpm_coa -= 15; gdsu_coa -= 15; fvp_coa -= 10; ppu_coa -= 10; fvp_coa += 5 if fvp_path >= 1; gdsu_coa += 5 if gdsu_ideology >= 2; ppu_coa += 5 if ppu_path >= 1;
go-to: coalition

@kpm_gov_drop
view-if: sapd_formed > 0 and sapd_merf_coa = 1
on-arrival: sapd_merf_coa = 0;  custom_coalition_merf -= sapd_merf; ldp_coa += 20; blpm_coa += 15; gdsu_coa += 15; fvp_coa += 10; ppu_coa += 10; fvp_coa -= 5 if fvp_path >= 1; gdsu_coa -= 5 if gdsu_ideology >= 2; ppu_coa -= 5 if ppu_path >= 1;
go-to: coalition

@asum_gov
view-if: asum_formed > 0 and asum_merf_coa = 0
choose-if: (kpm_coa + spm_coa) >= 100
on-arrival: asum_merf_coa = 1; custom_coalition_merf += asum_merf; ldp_coa -= 5; blpm_coa -= 4; gdsu_coa -= 3;
go-to: coalition

@asum_gov_drop
view-if: asum_formed > 0 and asum_merf_coa = 1
on-arrival: asum_merf_coa = 0; custom_coalition_merf -= asum_merf; ldp_coa += 5; blpm_coa += 4; gdsu_coa += 3;
go-to: coalition 

@spm_gov
view-if: spm_formed > 0
choose-if: spm_coa >= 50
on-arrival: spm_merf_coa = 1; custom_coalition_merf += spm_merf; 
go-to: coalition

@spm_gov_drop
view-if: spm_formed > 0 and spm_merf_coa = 1
on-arrival: spm_merf_coa = 0; custom_coalition_merf -= spm_merf;
go-to: coalition

@vsp_gov
choose-if: (fvp_coa + kpm_coa + ldp_coa) >= 120 and vsp_merf_coa = 0
on-arrival: vsp_coa = 1; custom_coalition_merf += other_merf/5; 
go-to: coalition

@vsp_gov_drop
view-if: vsp_coa = 1
on-arrival: vsp_coa = 0; custom_coalition_merf -= other_merf/5;
go-to: coalition

@fvp_gov
choose-if: fvp_coa >= 50 and fvp_merf_coa = 0
on-arrival: fvp_merf_coa = 1; custom_coalition_merf += ddp_merf; kpm_coa += 5 if fvp_path >= 1; kpm_coa -= 10;
go-to: coalition

@fvp_gov_drop
view-if: fvp_merf_coa = 1
on-arrival: fvp_merf_coa = 0; custom_coalition_merf -= ddp_merf; kpm_coa -= 5 if fvp_path >= 1; kpm_coa += 10;
go-to: coalition

@gdsu_gov
view-if: gdsu_coa >= 40
choose-if: gdsu_coa >= 50 and gdsu_merf_coa = 0
on-arrival: gdsu_merf_coa = 1; custom_coalition_merf += z_merf; kpm_coa += 5 if gdsu_ideology >= 2; kpm_coa -= 15;
go-to: coalition

@gdsu_gov_drop
view-if: gdsu_merf_coa = 1
on-arrival: asum_merf_coa = 0; custom_coalition_merf -= z_merf; kpm_coa -= 5 if gdsu_ideology >= 2; kpm_coa += 15;
go-to: coalition

@ppu_gov
view-if: ppu_coa >= 40
choose-if: ppu_coa >= 50 and ppu_merf_coa = 0
on-arrival: ppu_merf_coa = 1; custom_coalition_merf += ppu_merf; kpm_coa += 5 if ppu_path >= 1; kpm_coa -= 15;
go-to: coalition

@ppu_gov_drop
view-if: ppu_merf_coa = 1
on-arrival: asum_merf_coa = 0; custom_coalition_merf -= ppu_merf; kpm_coa -= 5 if ppu_path >= 1; kpm_coa += 15;
go-to: coalition

@blpm_gov
view-if: blpm_formed > 0 and blpm_merf_coa = 0 and blpm_coa >= 40
choose-if: blpm_coa >= 50
on-arrival: blpm_merf_coa = 1; custom_coalition_merf += blpm_merf; kpm_coa -= 15;
go-to: coalition

@blpm_gov_drop
view-if: blpm_formed > 0 and blpm_merf_coa = 1 
on-arrival: blpm_merf_coa = 0; custom_coalition_merf -= blpm_merf; kpm_coa += 15;
go-to: coalition

@ldp_gov
view-if: ldp_coa >= 40
choose-if: ldp_coa >= 50 and ldp_merf_coa = 0
on-arrival: ldp_merf_coa = 1; custom_coalition_merf += dvp_merf;
go-to: coalition

@ldp_gov_drop
view-if: ldp_merf_coa = 1
on-arrival: ldp_merf_coa = 0; custom_coalition_merf -= dvp_merf; 
go-to: coalition

@custom
choose-if: custom_coalition_merf >= 50
on-arrival: {!

Q.fvp_coa -= Q.party_policy_main*2;
Q.gdsu_coa -= Q.party_policy_main*3;
Q.ldp_coa -= Q.party_policy_main*4;

Q.fvp_coa -= Q.liberal_allience*3;
Q.gdsu_coa -= Q.liberal_allience*5;
Q.ldp_coa -= Q.liberal_allience*7;

if(Q.ldp_merf_coa > 0 && Q.ldp_coa <= 50)
{Q.failed = 1; Q.coa_tention += Q.ldp_coa - 50;}

if(Q.blpm_merf_coa > 0 && Q.blpm_coa <= 50)
{Q.failed = 1; Q.coa_tention += Q.blpm_coa - 50;}

if(Q.sapd_merf_coa > 0 && Q.kpm_coa <= 50)
{Q.failed = 1; Q.coa_tention += Q.kpm_coa - 50;}

if(Q.spm_merf_coa > 0 && Q.spm_coa <= 50)
{Q.failed = 1; Q.coa_tention += Q.spm_coa - 50;}

if(Q.fvp_merf_coa > 0 && Q.fvp_coa <= 50)
{Q.failed = 1; Q.coa_tention += Q.fvp_coa - 50;}

if(Q.fvp_merf_coa > 0 && Q.liberal_reconciliation <= 10)
{Q.failed = 1; Q.coa_tention += Q.liberal_reconciliation;}

if(Q.gdsu_merf_coa > 0 && Q.gdsu_coa <= 50)
{Q.failed = 1; Q.coa_tention += Q.gdsu_coa - 50;}

if(Q.gdsu_merf_coa > 0 && Q.liberal_reconciliation <= 14)
{Q.failed = 1; Q.coa_tention += Q.liberal_reconciliation;}

if(Q.ppu_merf_coa > 0 && Q.ppu_coa <= 50)
{Q.failed = 1; Q.coa_tention += Q.ppu_coa - 50;}

if(Q.ldp_merf_coa > 0 && Q.sapd_merf_coa > 0)
{Q.failed = 1; Q.coa_tention += Q.ldp_coa; Q.coa_tention += Q.kpm_coa;}

if(Q.ldp_merf_coa > 0 && Q.liberal_reconciliation <= 18)
{Q.failed = 1; Q.coa_tention += Q.liberal_reconciliation;}

!}
go-to: custom_sucess if failed = 0; custom_failed if failed > 1

@custom_sucess
on-arrival: {!

if(Q.ldp_merf_coa > 0)
{Q.dvp_merf_gov = 1; Q.old_middle_dvp += 1; Q.dvp_merf_mod += 5; Q.dvp_relation += 2*Q.ldp_modifier;}

if(Q.blpm_merf_coa > 0)
{Q.blpm_merf_gov = 1; Q.new_middle_blpm += 1; Q.blpm_merf_mod += 5;}

if(Q.sapd_merf_coa > 0)
{Q.sapd_merf_gov = 1; Q.workers_sapd += 1; Q.sapd_merf_mod += 5; Q.sapd_relation += 2*Q.kpm_modifier}

if(Q.spm_merf_coa > 0)
{Q.spm_merf_gov = 1; Q.new_middle_spm += 1; Q.spm_merf_mod += 5;}

if(Q.fvp_merf_coa > 0)
{Q.ddp_merf_gov = 1; Q.new_middle_ddp += 1; Q.ddp_merf_mod += 5; Q.ddp_relation += 2*Q.fvp_modifer;}

if(Q.gdsu_merf_coa > 0)
{Q.z_merf_gov = 1; Q.rural_z += 1; Q.z_merf_mod += 5; Q.z_relation += 2*Q.gdsu_modifer;}

if(Q.ppu_merf_coa > 0)
{Q.ppu_merf_gov = 1; Q.minorieties_ppu += 1; Q.ppu_merf_mod += 5; Q.ppu_relation += 2;}

if(Q.asum_merf_coa > 0)
{Q.asum_merf_gov = 1; Q.peasants_asum += 1; Q.asum_merf_mod += 5;}

Q.workers_spd += 2;

!}

Our Coalition planning succeded and we succesfully entered the goverment! 

@custom_failed
go-to: custom_try if coa_tention <= 15; custom_failed_2 if coa_tention > 15

Talks about this coalition are in progress, yet we still are not sure if the coalition can work. 

[? if kpm_coa <= 50 and kpm_merf_coa >= 1 : <span style="color: #940000;">KPM</span> could have a problem with this coalition ?]
[? if asum_coa <= 50 and asum_merf_coa >= 1 : <span style="color: #dd5b00;">ASUM</span> could have a problem with this coalition ?]
[? if spm_coa <= 50 and spm_merf_coa >= 1 : <span style="color: #ff1919;">SPM</span> could have a problem with this coalition ?]
[? if fvp_coa <= 50 and fvp_merf_coa >= 1 : <span style="color: #ddd500;">FVP</span> could have a problem with this coalition ?]
[? if gdsu_coa <= 50 and gdsu_merf_coa >= 1 : <span style="color: #48ba48;">GDSU</span> could have a problem with this coalition ?]
[? if ppu_coa <= 50 and ppu_merf_coa >= 1 : <span style="color: #4b9fde;">PPU</span> could have a problem with this coalition ?]
[? if blpm_coa <= 50 and blpm_merf_coa >= 1 : <span style="color: #00e8ff;">BLPM</span> could have a problem with this coalition ?]
[? if ldp_coa <= 50 and ldp_merf_coa >= 1 : <span style="color: #caa58b;">[+ dvp_name +]</span> could have a problem with this coalition ?]
[? if ldp_merf_coa > 0 and sapd_merf_coa > 0 : <span style="color: #caa58b;">[+ dvp_name +]</span> and <span style="color: #940000;">KPM</span> will never cooperate ?]

@custom_try

We could try to convince some unwilling partners to maybe try this coalition.

-@bribe: Maybe we can try to pull some contacts and strings to make it work.
-@concede: Concede on most of the major issues and essentaly promice a bit stronger "toleration".
-@coalition: Return to the drawing board. 

@concede
on-arrival: state_corruption += 1; resources -= 2; spd_merf_mod -= 20; workers_spd -= 2.5; new_middle_spd -= 2; left_dissent += 2; labor_dissent += 2; center_dissent += 2; reformist_dissent += 1; revolutionaries_dissent += 3; agrarnians_dissent += 2;
choose-if: spd_merf >= 28
unavailable-subtitle: We dont play big enough role in the Caversket to have much to concede from. 
go-to: custom_sucess

We conceded on a many major issues massively watering down our promices, that will shurely cost us some electorate, but we still managed to enter the goverment.

@bribe
on-arrival: state_corruption += 1; resources -= 2; left_dissent += 2; labor_dissent += 2; center_dissent += 2; reformist_dissent += 1; revolutionaries_dissent += 3; agrarnians_dissent += 2;
choose-if: resources >= 2
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
go-to: custom_sucess

After pulling some strings we manged to convice them to make a goverment with us. 


@custom_failed_2

Even though we work our best to make the coalition work, there are some underlying problem that we cannot resolve. 

-@coalition: We must return to the drawing board. 

@continue

Governing Arrangement:

